node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store

# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# It was, and that broke CI: the workflow installs with `npm ci`, which
# requires a lock file and refuses to run without one. On a fresh clone there
# was none, so the job would have failed before reaching a single test.
#
# Committing it also pins the transitive tree, which is what makes an
# `npx hermes-remote` install reproducible and turns an unexpected dependency
# change into a reviewable diff.
